@baseUrl = {{$dotenv BE_BASE_URL}}/api
@adminUrl = {{$dotenv BE_BASE_URL}}/admin
@adminToken = {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Search (logged when it has a keyword or a filter, first page only). ref = random id made by the browser,
### sk = random id of the browser, aud/lage = who the courses are for (child|self, age)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=cờ%20vua&age=6-10&location=79&ref=abc123def456ghi789&sk=browser0123456789&aud=child&lage=9

### The visitor opened a result of that search (only the first click is kept)
POST {{baseUrl}}/search/click
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ref": "abc123def456ghi789", "itemId": 5 }

### "Tìm giúp tôi": open to visitors without an account. 3 requests per phone number per 24 hours.
POST {{baseUrl}}/course-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mẹ Bin",
  "phone": "0912 345 678",
  "subject": "Cờ vua cho bé",
  "learnerAge": 9,
  "provinceCode": "79",
  "districtText": "Quận 7",
  "budgetMax": 2000000,
  "preferredTime": "weekend",
  "mode": "offline",
  "note": "gần nhà",
  "sourceRef": "abc123def456ghi789"
}

### Admin: requests (new ones first). status = new | contacting | matched | no_partner | closed
GET {{adminUrl}}/course-requests?status=new
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: handle a request. "matched" needs matchedItemId and notifies the requester when they have an account
PUT {{adminUrl}}/course-requests/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "matched", "matchedItemId": 5, "adminNote": "Đã gọi, hẹn học thử thứ 7" }

### Admin: what visitors look for and cannot find (days = 1..365, default 30)
GET {{adminUrl}}/insights/search?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: who else receives the back-office notifications (besides role admin)
GET {{adminUrl}}/notification-recipients
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: replace the added members (max 50; not admins, children or locked accounts)
PUT {{adminUrl}}/notification-recipients
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userIds": [123, 456] }

### Admin: send a test notification to everyone on the list
POST {{adminUrl}}/notification-recipients/test
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
